 area, second kitchen, third bedroom, bathroom, laundry and storage. A separate side entrance adds convenience. Enjoy a fenced yard with garden beds, a shed and deck. The oversized heated triple detached garage has plumbing for a sink & toilet and a separate 100 amp electrical panel. Close to schools, amenities, public transit and Mill Creek Ravine. An outstanding opportunity in a popular community centrally located to wherever you need to go! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$379,888"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,002 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,390 sq ft"],["Year built","1954"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Hazeldean"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6E0H9"],["MLS® number","E4516200"],["Listed","November 12, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.62 m × 5.98 m (15'2\" × 19'7\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.33 m × 3.02 m (14'2\" × 9'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.22 m × 4.21 m (10'7\" × 13'10\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.83 m × 3.26 m (12'7\" × 10'8\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.27 m × 4.06 m (10'9\" × 13'4\")"],["Bedroom 3","Basement","3.76 m × 3.61 m (12'4\" × 11'10\")"],["Second Kitchen","Basement","2.96 m × 3.05 m (9'9\" × 10'0\")"],["Laundry room","Basement","2.56 m × 2.25 m (8'5\" × 7'5\")"]],"courtesy":"Stephen Lau, RE/MAX Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"hazeldean","area":"southeast-edmonton"}